<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Delphi Financial raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Delphi Financial raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer confirmed Wednesday it raised its rating on the shares of Delphi Financial Group Inc to outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Paul Newsome said Delphi Financial was a high-quality company which had become cheap relative to its peers, after it released second quarter results.</p>
<p>-- Newsome said his 12-month price target was $48 a share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;People overreacted to the second quarter results, because expectations had been too high,&quot; Newsome said. &quot;We thought the results were quite solid.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 2-11/16 to 42-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
